.Dd August 14, 2026
.Dt FILEES-ENTRY 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm filees-entry
.Nd FileES OTP-tunnel forced command
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the
.Xr sshd 8
forced command for
.Sy _filees-tunnel .
It accepts only the literal remote command
.Cm filees tunnel-v1 .
.Pp
BSD Auth has already compared the OTP.
.Nm
then claims the operation bundle, confirming the reverse forward to
.Li 127.0.0.1:42000 ,
and execs
.Xr filees-worker 8
for the rest of the activation.
The OTP is not taken from the environment;
.Xr sshd 8
does not propagate BSD Auth
.Ic setenv
values to the forced command.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr filees-ssh-auth 8 ,
.Xr filees-worker 8
